# Testing & Validation Rules

- Keep Central UI changes compatible with `central-ui-automation` (TAC) selectors: `mfc-ejs-tab`, `mfc-ejs-grid`, and existing test ids.
- Do not rename stable ids, headers, or permission keys without updating the matching automation.
- Verify the touched screen still loads, filters, pages, and saves.
- Check the empty, loading, forbidden (`pagePermissions.VIEW`), and error states.
- Do not leave `test.only` or debug overlays in the app.
